              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "guarire — \"to recover, to get better; to heal\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Sono guarito in pochi giorni. I got better in a few days."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "With essere when you get better (sono guarito), with avere when you heal someone (il medico mi ha guarito)."
            }
